definition.message:
{{#is_alert}}
**{{product.name}} reaches end of life in {{value}} days.**

This is the soonest scheduled end of life among the {{product.name}} release lines in scope: every line endoflife.ai tracks, or only the versions you listed in EOL_PRODUCTS.

After the EOL date the vendor's regular security updates stop for this release line, so new CVEs against it can stay open. The comfortable migration window is closing.

- Dates and upgrade path: https://endoflife.ai/{{product.name}}
- What to do: schedule the upgrade now, or evaluate extended support before the deadline.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_warning}}
{{product.name}} is inside 60 days of end of life — put the migration on this quarter's plan.
{{/is_warning}}

{{#is_recovery}}
{{product.name}} is no longer inside the approaching-EOL window (the date passed or the lifecycle changed) — check https://endoflife.ai/{{product.name}} for current status.
{{/is_recovery}}

Methodology: https://endoflife.ai/risk-score
